{"4342720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VILE", "steam_appid": 4342720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>London, 1885.</strong><br>A grotesque plague has spread through the fog-choked streets, twisting the dead into nightmarish abominations. The city’s gas lamps still burn but the air smells foul and hope is starting to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parliament has issued a desperate decree to you: <strong>eradicate the vile undead, uncover the source of the plague, and save the Empire from collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with experimental fantasy weaponry, you’ll hunt through plague-ridden town streets, workhouses, graveyards and claustrophobic alleyways. Destroy the hordes or end up being a part of them yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield 7 high-powered guns; Pistol, Rifle, Shotgun, Uzis, Grenade Launcher, Flamethrower and the Lightning Hammer. Mow down 16 different types of the undead and 4 bosses. Purge Her Majesty's London… or become part of its decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old-school retro FPS / Boomer Shooter inspired by 90's classics such as Doom, Blood, Shadow Warrior and Duke Nukem 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342720/extras/90ee2934281a0d780a9e4a35d7b9f77c.poster.avif?t=1778286154\" width=720 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342720/extras/90ee2934281a0d780a9e4a35d7b9f77c.webm?t=1778286154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342720/extras/90ee2934281a0d780a9e4a35d7b9f77c.mp4?t=1778286154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>London, 1885.</strong><br>A grotesque plague has spread through the fog-choked streets, twisting the dead into nightmarish abominations. The city’s gas lamps still burn but the air smells foul and hope is starting to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parliament has issued a desperate decree to you: <strong>eradicate the vile undead, uncover the source of the plague, and save the Empire from collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with experimental fantasy weaponry, you’ll hunt through plague-ridden town streets, workhouses, graveyards and claustrophobic alleyways. Destroy the hordes or end up being a part of them yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield 7 high-powered guns; Pistol, Rifle, Shotgun, Uzis, Grenade Launcher, Flamethrower and the Lightning Hammer. Mow down 16 different types of the undead and 4 bosses. Purge Her Majesty's London… or become part of its decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old-school retro FPS / Boomer Shooter inspired by 90's classics such as Doom, Blood, Shadow Warrior and Duke Nukem 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342720/extras/90ee2934281a0d780a9e4a35d7b9f77c.poster.avif?t=1778286154\" width=720 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342720/extras/90ee2934281a0d780a9e4a35d7b9f77c.webm?t=1778286154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342720/extras/90ee2934281a0d780a9e4a35d7b9f77c.mp4?t=1778286154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A grotesque plague is mutating and reanimating London’s de